          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3><strong>Stronger, fuller-looking hair starts with a healthy scalp.</strong></h3><p>Hair thinning and reduced density can affect both men and women, with changes in follicular activity and scalp condition influencing hair quality. Excess sebum, flaking and build-up can contribute to scalp imbalance, while weakened hair may become finer and more prone to breakage. Targeted scalp care, combined with professional hair regeneration treatments, can help support follicular activity, improve scalp health and promote stronger, fuller-looking hair.</p>"
