    "image_with_text_html_RfFfaL": {
      "type": "image-with-text-html",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_ab8Ucp": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The importance of scalp health",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_7kYypx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The scalp is an extension of the skin and requires targeted care to maintain a healthy environment for hair follicles.</p>\n<p>Effective scalp care helps manage excess sebum, flaking and build-up while supporting hydration and scalp balance. For those experiencing hair thinning, combining scalp care\nwith regenerative formulations provides a more comprehensive approach to hair health.</p>\n<p><strong>ALLSKIN | MED combines advanced scalp care, patented growth factor technology and professional treatment protocols to support healthier, stronger and fuller looking hair.</strong></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
