    "image_with_text_html_9JTXge": {
      "type": "image-with-text-html",
      "blocks": {
        "caption_maKMDE": {
          "type": "caption",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "THE SCIENCE",
            "text_style": "caption-with-letter-spacing",
            "text_size": "medium"
          }
        },
        "heading_tdTXxw": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Introducing Wharton Gel Complex® Technology",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_aiTEkH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Wharton Gel Complex® is a patented growth factor technology developed to support scalp regeneration and follicular activity. Rich in <strong>growth factors, hyaluronic acid and glycosaminoglycans</strong>, it helps support the scalp environment and promote stronger, healthier-looking hair.</p>\n<p>The technology features in ALLSKIN | MED’s professional <strong>Anti-Hair Loss &amp; Redensifying Booster (1.5%)</strong> and complementary <strong>Anti-Hair Loss &amp; Redensifying Lotion (1%)</strong>, providing targeted support through in-clinic treatments and ongoing homecare.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:24px;\">In a clinical evaluation involving 16 patients, the professional Redensifying Booster used alongside microneedling demonstrated, after 90 days:<sup>1</sup></p>\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;margin:16px 0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;\">\n<li style=\"flex:1 1 140px;background:#ffffff;padding:20px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:4px;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-weight:700;font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:.6px;color:#165c7d;\">79%</span><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;\">reduction in hair loss</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"flex:1 1 140px;background:#ffffff;padding:20px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:4px;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-weight:700;font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:.6px;color:#165c7d;\">67%</span><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;\">increase in hair thickness</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"flex:1 1 140px;background:#ffffff;padding:20px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:4px;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-weight:700;font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:.6px;color:#165c7d;\">9%</span><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;\">increase in hair density</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:.4px;\">Results relate to the professional Booster and microneedling protocol, not the standalone at-home Hair Regeneration Plan.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
